<!--
  L4-L8 - Zeitzeugen-Interview. SocialSuperInteraction targeting a Sim.
  Target requirement: Elder (test_globals sim_info age gate on TargetSim).
  Band gated in level_gate.py. Minimal shape mirroring EA's
  interactions.social.social_super_interaction (no animation/posture refs):
  one_shot -> our HC_Loot_Add_HistorianLevel_Small loot. The Elder-target
  gate is only truly verifiable in-game; implemented per EA's sim_info shape.
-->
<I c="SocialSuperInteraction" i="interaction" m="interactions.social.social_super_interaction" n="HC_Interaction_Zeitzeugen" s="TBD_INSTANCE_ID">
